WEBVTT

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:03.368
Choose one small improvement: a clear dispute hold

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:07.455
and usable backup handoff. Compare effort before and

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.554
after within the same task boundary, including checking

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:14.417
and follow-up. Retain actual observations; do not invent

00:00:14.506 --> 00:00:17.908
saved time. Save the future-state map, three-step screen

00:00:18.088 --> 00:00:21.906
and improvement test. Write the Operations Responsibility Statement

00:00:21.951 --> 00:00:26.262
with primary owner, backup, human-led decision, takeover trigger,

00:00:26.442 --> 00:00:30.818
monitoring, fallback and maintenance. Keep untested parts marked

00:00:30.953 --> 00:00:34.770
as proposed or pending. The human decision should

00:00:34.816 --> 00:00:36.826
reflect the evidence and its limits.
